   "source": [
    "When performing such a gradient the dimensions dimnishes, definitely.\n",
    "* Image size - decreases\n",
    "* Volume size - well, you substract stuff, so that also gets smaller.\n",
    "    * You actually end up with a range [-1,1] or [`-frame.max()`, `frame.max()`]"
   ]
  },
